description	"Nightbrother Warrior 

Melee Infantry with specialized energy bows and poisoned weapons along with martial art skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Nightbrother Melee Weapon
- Dual Knives (Duals/Cyan)
- Mace (Red/Purple)
- Spear (Staff/Blue)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Poisons/Staggers
-- Lower Damage
- Energy Bow (T-21 3)
-- Staggers/Ignites on hit
-- 35% faster Shot Swap
-- 50% slower Mag Reload
-- Prim only

^5Powers:
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (3)
- 50% less Kb Taken
- 10% more Kb Given
- Dexterity (2)
- Strength (1)
- Fury (3)
- Getup (2)
- Assemble (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dark Rage ^3[CS2]
- Bowkick ^3[CS3]"
